#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:2
msgid "Faces Gamepad3 Module"
msgstr "Faces Gamepad3 模块"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:8
msgid ""
"Faces Gamepad3 is an eight-button input module. Button states are active-"
"low: a cleared bit means that the button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Faces Gamepad3 是一个八按键输入模块。按键状态采用低电平有效：清零的位"
"表示对应按键被按下。"

