msgid "UiFlow2 Example"
msgstr "UiFlow2 应用示例"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:19
#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:33
msgid "Button event display"
msgstr "按键事件显示"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:21
msgid ""
"This example reports press and release events for the Up and Down "
"buttons. The callback receives ``True`` when the selected button is "
"pressed and ``False`` when it is released."
msgstr ""
"该示例演示 Up 和 Down 按键的按下与释放事件。选中按键被按下时，回调收到"
" ``True``；释放时收到 ``False``。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:27
msgid "Open the |faces_gamepad3_cores3_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |faces_gamepad3_cores3_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:30
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 应用示例"

#: ../../source/module/faces_gamepad3.rst:35
msgid ""
"Register one callback for each button that should be monitored, then call"
" :meth:`FacesGamepad3Module.tick` regularly from the main loop."
msgstr "为需要监测的每个按键注册回调，然后在主循环中定期调用"
" :meth:`FacesGamepad3Module.tick`。"

