#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.is_pressed:1 of
msgid "Check whether a button or button combination is pressed."
msgstr "检查一个按键或按键组合是否被按下。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.is_pressed:3 of
msgid "One or more ``BUTTON_*`` masks."
msgstr "一个或多个 ``BUTTON_*`` 掩码。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.is_pressed:4 of
msgid "Optional state previously returned by :meth:`get_key_state`."
msgstr "可选的、之前由 :meth:`get_key_state` 返回的状态。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.is_pressed:5 of
msgid "``True`` when every selected button is pressed."
msgstr "选中的所有按键均被按下时返回 ``True``。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.set_callback:1 of
msgid "Set the callback for one button's state changes."
msgstr "设置一个按键状态变化回调。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.set_callback:3 of
msgid "The callback receives ``pressed``. Pass ``None`` to remove the callback."
msgstr "回调会收到 ``pressed``，传入 ``None`` 可移除回调。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.set_callback:5 of
msgid "One ``BUTTON_*`` constant."
msgstr "一个 ``BUTTON_*`` 常量。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.set_callback:6 of
msgid "Callable accepting the pressed state, or ``None``."
msgstr "接收按键状态或 ``None`` 的可调用对象。"

#: module.faces.FacesGamepad3Module.tick:1 of
msgid "Poll once and invoke the callback for each changed button."
msgstr "轮询一次，并为每个发生变化的按键调用回调。"

